answers.approach:
Hush, little draft; map claims to proof, with rights and rules in rows,
Then learn from every human stop exactly where risk grows.

No all-wise checker gets to bless each generated cue;
Constrain the model, show its evidence, and route the rest to review.

Test brand meaning with examples, and track when source trails fray;
Put disclosures in the rendered ad, since tags may fall away.

Audit samples after shipping, and let risk control each lane;
The queue may shrink, but judgment stays—and doubt will still remain.
